# Data Quality

Every company should track:

- Last Verified
- Last Crawled
- Source Count
- Data Quality Score (future)

---

# Core Business Rules

BR-001

A company represents a legal organisation.

BR-002

A company may have multiple roles.

BR-003

A company may have multiple products.

BR-004

A company may have multiple certifications.

BR-005

A company has exactly one Golden Record.

BR-006

AI must never overwrite verified data.

BR-007

Every important fact should have evidence.

BR-008

Every company should be independently refreshable.

